# Semantic Research for Digital Libraries.

**Authors:** Chen, Hsinchun

## Abstract
Discusses the need for semantic research in digital libraries to help overcome interoperability problems. Highlights include federal initiatives; semantic analysis; knowledge representations; human-computer interactions and information visualization; and the University of Illinois DLI (Digital Libraries Initiative) project through partnership with the Artificial Intelligence Lab at the University of Arizona. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ601936

